{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoominoes is a tile based roguelike deckbuilder all about combining cards to score massive points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/4_Moth_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crazy Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade animals using snacks and souvenirs to create crazy combos. Transform your simple starting deck into the perfect masterpiece. Manipulate the board to boost your score even more. Focus on different animal types or colors, and grow your tiles with permanent power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/2_Snacks_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoominoes is filled with animals from cute to mythical, tons of snacks and souvenirs in the gift shop, and a variety of zookeepers that start each run. Find super rare mythical animals with insanely powerful abilities. Unlock and collect them all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Zookeeeprs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">19 Snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">86 Animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">65 Souvenirs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/1_Collection_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Mode: Keep your run going after beating the full month. Try to score as many points as you can.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Events: Special events provide unique challenges at the end of the week. Some even make crazy changes to the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeded Runs: See if you can beat your friends with the exact same random events. Find the perfect run to score insane points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tough Challenges: Beat all 8 difficulty settings with each Zookeeper. Challenges range from higher score targets to Ants sneaking into your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/3_Mirror_Header_2.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282420?t=1744311648","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282420?t=1744311648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/8554d27764fab66fba85ccd047f61ec8fdac8854/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744311648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/8554d27764fab66fba85ccd047f61ec8fdac8854/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744311648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3518930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoominoes is a tile based roguelike deckbuilder all about combining cards to score massive points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/4_Moth_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crazy Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade animals using snacks and souvenirs to create crazy combos. Transform your simple starting deck into the perfect masterpiece. Manipulate the board to boost your score even more. Focus on different animal types or colors, and grow your tiles with permanent power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/2_Snacks_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoominoes is filled with animals from cute to mythical, tons of snacks and souvenirs in the gift shop, and a variety of zookeepers that start each run. Find super rare mythical animals with insanely powerful abilities. Unlock and collect them all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Zookeeeprs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">19 Snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">86 Animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">65 Souvenirs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/1_Collection_Header.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Mode: Keep your run going after beating the full month. Try to score as many points as you can.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Events: Special events provide unique challenges at the end of the week. Some even make crazy changes to the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeded Runs: See if you can beat your friends with the exact same random events. Find the perfect run to score insane points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tough Challenges: Beat all 8 difficulty settings with each Zookeeper. Challenges range from higher score targets to Ants sneaking into your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282420/extras/3_Mirror_Header_2.gif?t=1744311648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Starlight Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image